		{
			dependencies: ["000BD12C69745ED5"]
			description: [
				"Build the Sample Infuser. It turns supported DNA or blood samples into eggs of extinct creatures."
				"A Great Auk Feather can provide a sample for the infuser. Break Feather Bundles to find feathers; the Great Auk variety is one possible result. Bundle Monsters can drop these bundles, and the Wandering Trader sells them for five Primal Coins each. Hunt Bundle Monsters in Skull Cavern at Y 0-142, or Big Bundle Monsters in Overworld Dark Forests. Use the sample slot and Infuse button after extracting your sample."
